. * ======================================================
> =======================
. * Difference-in-Differences Analysis (UNWEIGHTED)
. * Outcomes: quota, matched, unmatched (quota - matched)
. * Event-study plotting follows prior scheme (pre/post sh
> ading + bands)
. * NOTE: This version does NOT use population weights
. * ======================================================
> =======================
. 
. clear all

. set more off

